  "label": "Service Request",
  "description": "The model covers details about a requested service or services. One order may include several requests. Xt-EHR EHDS EHDSServiceRequest. openEHR archetypes of the same concept, linked by CKM citeable identifier: openEHR-EHR-INSTRUCTION.service_request.v1 (in_development). A record of the SDCHealth library (Xt-EHR EHDS logical models 1.0.0), chained to its report by Parent Record Identifier (PRD decision 12); copy it and edit the copy.",
